      "translations": [
        "I've been learning Chinese for half a year. In the evenings I often watch Chinese TV.",
        "There's a little boy in one show. He's really fun, and I like him a lot.",
        "He talks very fast. When I can't catch it, I read the characters at the bottom.",
        "Today he said: “I'm hungry!” I caught every word!",
        "I was really happy. I was hungry too, so I went to eat. I'm watching again tomorrow."
